  "description": "Click here and download the Christmas Bauble Lantern Ornament STL · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Create a warm and elegant holiday atmosphere with this Christmas Bauble Lantern Ornament 3D STL. This unique spherical ornament combines the classic shape of a Christmas bauble with an open decorative lantern-style center, creating a beautiful display piece for the holiday season.\n\nThe design features a faceted geometric outer surface, a smooth circular opening, a detailed decorative bow with holly leaves and berries, and an ornate top cap with an integrated hanging loop. The spacious interior can be used as a decorative display cavity or adapted for suitable LED-style lighting applications.\n\nFeatures\nElegant spherical Christmas bauble silhouette\nOpen lantern-style front cavity\nFaceted geometric surface pattern\nDecorative holly leaves and berry cluster\nDetailed Christmas bow accent\nOrnamental top cap\nIntegrated hanging loop\nStable rounded lower base\nPremium festive decorative appearance\nIdeal for Christmas tabletop and hanging displays\nPerfect For\n\nChristmas tree decorations, holiday centerpieces, festive lantern displays, seasonal home décor, Christmas gifts, holiday craft projects, and 3D-printable Christmas collections.\n\nPlease Note: This is a digital 3D model file. No physical product will be shipped. Please check your 3D printer and slicing software compatibility before printing. This 3D model is available only in STL color — if you’d like it colored, you’ll need to open the STL file in separate software to color it yourself.",
